{
  "job_A3.26_20251003_114211": {
    "chunk_text": "a\u00f0. Eala Iordane in Iudeum, hu \u00feu in \u00fe\u00e6re stowe stille gewunadest. Nales \u00feu geondflowan foldbuende; mostan hy \u00feynes w\u00e6tres wynnum brucan. Nu ic \u00fee halsie, h\u00e6lend user, deope in gedyrstum, \u00feu eart dryhten Crist, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu us gemiltsie, monna \u00deu fore monna lufan \u00feinre modor bosm sylfa gesohtes, sigedryhten god, nales fore \u00feinre \u00feearfe, \u00feeoda \u00deu meaht ymbfon eal folca gesetu, swylce \u00feu meaht geriman, rice dryhten, s\u00e6s sondgrotu, selast ealra Swylce ic \u00fee halsige, h\u00e6lend user, fore inum cildhade, cyninga selast, ond fore \u00fe\u00e6re wunde, weoruda Oferwurpe \u00feu mid \u00fey w\u00e6tre, weoruda dryhten, bli\u00fee mode ealle burgwaran, swylce git Iohannis in Sie \u00fe\u00e6s symle meotude \u00feonc..",
